          "text": "Na kweethĩwa mũthenya ũmwe yĩla ana make na eĩtu make maĩ makĩya na kũnyw’a mbinyu nyũmbanĩ ya mũkũũe woo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
